~ rat_talk_1
Rat: That was a close one. You need to be more careful from now on, okay?
Rat: Ever since they arrived, the raiders have been [color=red]hunting[/color] us down and [color=red]stealing[/color] our food.
	[i]Despicable...[/i]
Rat: I'm struggling to just get by with them messing everything up.
Rat: Like, I've got pup support to pay, man! You feel me?
=> END

~ rat_talk_2
Rat: ...Didn't know slimes can eat corpses like that. Impressive...
Rat: Did you get a bit bigger as well? [i]Must have been nutritious.[/i]
	You look quite a bit [color=yellow]stronger[/color] than before...
Rat: Hey, wait a minute. I've got a [color=green]brilliant[/color] idea.
Rat: You and I, if we work together... we might be able to take down a few raiders.
Rat: Then, you can [color=red]devour[/color] their corpses.
	Eventually, [color=orange]you'll become fearsome enough to chase them away![/color]
Rat: Come on, let me join you! Let's take back our home!
=> END

~ rat_suggests_roaming
Rat: Look at you, big guy! Does human taste good?
Rat: [color=yellow]Running around between areas[/color] will surely get us in contact with more.
	Not as easy to hide when you're [color=cyan]bigger[/color]...
Rat: So, we better be careful from now on.
	...Unless that's what you want...
=> END

